# ViewModel

One ViewModel class per file under `state/<feature>/`. Extends `ChangeNotifier`. Never import `material.dart`, `cupertino.dart`, or widgets.

- State fields are private. Expose read-only getters and intent methods (`selectColor`, `undo`).
- Constructor takes repository interfaces and engines, not concrete API or storage types.
- Pointer-move updates go through a separate `ValueNotifier` (see `activeStrokeTicks`). Do not `notifyListeners()` on every sample.
- Dispose everything this class creates.
- Do not construct repositories, `Dio`, or stores here.

```dart
// BAD
void extendStroke(Offset point) {
  _active.points.add(point);
  notifyListeners(); // rebuilds the whole screen
}

// GOOD
void extendStroke(Offset point) {
  _active.points.add(point);
  activeStrokeTicks.value++;
}
```
